{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13112410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13112410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1311241001:0":{"text":"Oh, it's you! What was your name...? Rhodes, was it...?","source_cn":"啊，是你！那个罗……罗德……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F667E527547C2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1311241001":{"text":"Oh, it's you! What was your name...? Rhodes, was it...?","source_cn":"啊，是你！那个罗……罗德……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F667E527547C2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311241002:0":{"text":"Please forgive me, I'm still getting used to this place. You see, every bit of my attention has been devoted to finishing this painting!","source_cn":"当然，当然……真抱歉，我对这里还不算熟悉。你瞧，我所有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3529164B6AE1514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311241003:0":{"text":"That's why His Grace brought me here. The princess wished for me to capture the joy of the Snowspire Festival on canvas for her.","source_cn":"这也是大公邀请我来白山的原因，公主殿下希望我能用一幅画...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78642695CEC8D0E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311241004:0":{"text":"I wish I could see the festival myself. His Grace is concerned that bringing anything in from outside might worsen the princess' condition, so I'm not allowed to leave the castle.","source_cn":"可惜，我没法亲自观察祭典的场面。大公大人担心我会从城堡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A5B9390EF6B525D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311241005:0":{"text":"I guess I'll just wait for the princess to return and share her experience with me.","source_cn":"不知道公主殿下什么时候能来给我讲讲有关祭典的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E5A83EA84573025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1311241005":{"text":"I guess I'll just wait for the princess to return and share her experience with me.","source_cn":"不知道公主殿下什么时候能来给我讲讲有关祭典的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E5A83EA84573025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311241006:0":{"text":"What?! Then I can't possibly finish this painting!","source_cn":"无法前来？！这样的话，这幅画就没办法完成了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E73C9C4DFB196CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1311241006":{"text":"What?! Then I can't possibly finish this painting!","source_cn":"无法前来？！这样的话，这幅画就没办法完成了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E73C9C4DFB196CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311241007:0":{"text":"That would be wonderful! Quick, tell me all the details about the festival!","source_cn":"真的吗？太好了！快，快给我详细地描述整个祭典的过程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25053F2050EFDDB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1311241007":{"text":"That would be wonderful! Quick, tell me all the details about the festival!","source_cn":"真的吗？太好了！快，快给我详细地描述整个祭典的过程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25053F2050EFDDB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311241008:0":{"text":"Opening ceremony... festival activities... Hmhmm, and lighting the eternal flame...","source_cn":"开幕……祭典项目……点火仪式……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217148F3DE92F10A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311241009:0":{"text":"I see, I see... The Chosen One gets to light the eternal flame and search for the seven-petaled sapphirine blossom... That sounds like an interesting festival ritual.","source_cn":"“受选者”点火，还要寻找七瓣蓝绒花？嗯，的确是有意思的习俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE5E79C4E0CD66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1311241014:0":{"text":"Thank you so much! I swear, this painting is going to be an absolute masterpiece!","source_cn":"太好了，感谢你的描述……我保证，这幅画绝对能成为传世佳作！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6AD7E60EEEBFE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"So the general flow is...","source_cn":"描述祭典流程","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA103D549A20D5418","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So the general flow is...","female":"So the general flow is...","variant_male_record_index":"68018","variant_female_record_index":"68019","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311241010:0":{"text":"I love building snowmen, and ice skating is a lot of fun... but the Ghostly Getaway...? I think I'll pass that one...","source_cn":"我喜欢堆雪人，滑冰也很有趣……鬼影密室，噢，恐怕我没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D5D104F24499379","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1311241011:0":{"text":"Oh, you're telling me there's a masquerade ball? Wow, maybe I should go next year! That sounds fantastic!","source_cn":"噢，还有化装舞会！这绝对是最棒的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6CFC49E76FE8D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"So the activities include...","source_cn":"详细说明祭典项目","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7DB825FCFE682B7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So the activities include...","female":"So the activities include...","variant_male_record_index":"68020","variant_female_record_index":"68021","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1311241012:0":{"text":"Ah... I can almost imagine the Ignis Core pulsing inside the crystal-clear ice sculpture!","source_cn":"啊……想想那一幕，火焰之心在晶莹剔透的冰雕中澎湃跳动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7BFC9111D005645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1311241013:0":{"text":"It's so divine, so awe-inspiring, and brimming with energy! I could almost weep just thinking about it!","source_cn":"多么神圣、多么崇高、多么具有生命力！艾雅在上，我简直要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD7D96011E2EA907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:2:3":{"text":"There's a ritual using flame...","source_cn":"讲述冰雕点火仪式","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x797CA3624EE42ABE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There's a ritual using flame...","female":"There's a ritual using flame...","variant_male_record_index":"68022","variant_female_record_index":"68023","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"I can describe it to you instead.","source_cn":"我可以给你讲述","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x009F8F3ED5D8D8B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I can describe it to you instead.","female":"I can describe it to you instead.","variant_male_record_index":"68016","variant_female_record_index":"68017","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"She won't come anymore.","source_cn":"公主殿下无法前来了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x61E83297393D6F69","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"She won't come anymore.","female":"She won't come anymore.","variant_male_record_index":"68012","variant_female_record_index":"68013","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"I can describe it to you instead.","source_cn":"我来给你讲述","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9830F7CB1E4FBED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I can describe it to you instead.","female":"I can describe it to you instead.","variant_male_record_index":"68014","variant_female_record_index":"68015","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"Rodrigo.","source_cn":"罗德里戈","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCA381AA8E5E6CDD1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Rodrigo.","female":"Rodrigo.","variant_male_record_index":"68006","variant_female_record_index":"68007","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"Forgetting someone's name is rude.","source_cn":"忘记名字是一种不尊重","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE747FA9DE0AA8718","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Forgetting someone's name is rude.","female":"Forgetting someone's name is rude.","variant_male_record_index":"68008","variant_female_record_index":"68009","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},